         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Sun Tzu and Learning\n\nWe learn something new every day. Sometimes we learn from good experiences; other times, from bad ones — ours or other people's. War is one such experience.\n\nIn this class, we will learn to build learning strategies based on plans and understanding ourselves, to improve our daily lives.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
