               "text": "Tzu, S. et al. (1963)",
               "page": "https://can-ada.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/The-Art-of-War.pdf",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1963",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "867d9985-b757-472a-8197-386486ec58d6",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=867d9985-b757-472a-8197-386486ec58d6",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned that the five factors of Sun Tzu (孙子) apply not only to daily life, but also to our families, our work, and other areas.\n\nThese factors help us organize our time and our lives.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
